    "head_commit_message": "docs(spec): spec 42 and Decisions 161 to 163, the metrics history (Q37)\n\nThe design session of 2026-11-06 on Q37 (#603). Measurements are kept\nin the repo under metrics/, one record a file, in one shape for every\nseries (Decision 161); a data-only PR runs only the checks data needs\n(Decision 162); bench, metrics-archive and bench-series merge their own\ndata PRs (Decision 163). Spec 42 builds the bench series in seven steps,\nthe raw archive of the expiring logs first. The other series are Q38\n(#747).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi1V2bSw43sosHniNHH",
